@startuml Deployment Architecture
title Deployment Architecture — Native macOS, Native Demo, and Source Development

!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60

actor "User" as User

package "Native macOS (default)" as NativeMac {
  node "Vision.app / Electron" as ElectronNative {
    component "Electron main + renderer" as ElectronUI
    component "Native runtime provider" as NativeProvider
    component "Compiled Bun backend" as NativeBackend
    component "Production frontend (dist)" as NativeFrontend
    component "Database tool (db-file)\n+ analysis SQL sandbox" as NativeDbTools
    component "db/migrations (in-process runner)" as NativeMigrations
  }
  folder "Application Support/Vision" as NativeData {
    database "database/vision.sqlite3\n(+ -wal / -shm)" as NativeDatabase
    folder "database/pre-migration-backups" as NativePreMigration
    folder "native/vision\nattachments · logs · runtime state" as NativeState
  }
  node "Local Ollama\n127.0.0.1:11434" as NativeOllama
}

package "Native Vision Demo (synthetic)" as NativeDemo {
  node "Vision Demo.app" as DemoElectron {
    component "Electron + shared native payload" as DemoRuntime
    artifact "vision-demo.sqlite3\n+ manifest.json" as DemoSeed
  }
  folder "Application Support/Vision Demo" as DemoData {
    database "database/vision.sqlite3" as DemoDatabase
    folder "native/vision_demo\nattachments · logs · seed state" as DemoState
  }
}

package "Source Development" as SourceDev {
  component "Vite frontend" as FrontendDev
  component "Bun backend" as BackendDev
  component "Electron shell\n(Vision Development profile)" as ElectronDev
  database "Application Support/Vision Development\ndatabase/vision.sqlite3" as DevelopmentDatabase
}

cloud "External data providers" as External

User --> ElectronUI : Desktop UI
ElectronUI --> NativeProvider : lifecycle / IPC
NativeProvider --> NativeBackend : spawn / stop / logs
NativeProvider --> NativeDbTools : check / snapshot / activate file
NativeBackend --> NativeMigrations : runMigrations() on boot
NativeBackend --> NativeFrontend : static files
NativeBackend --> NativeDatabase : one writer + readers (in-process)
NativeBackend --> NativePreMigration : copy before migrating
NativeBackend --> NativeState : attachments (absolute path)
ElectronUI --> NativeBackend : report document (HTML)
NativeBackend --> NativeOllama : local AI
NativeBackend --> External : HTTPS

User --> DemoRuntime : synthetic desktop UI
DemoRuntime --> DemoSeed : verify checksum / schema / counts
DemoRuntime --> DemoDatabase : activate seed copy + backend lifecycle
DemoRuntime --> DemoState : attachments / logs / activation state

User --> ElectronDev : development UI
ElectronDev --> BackendDev : native provider
FrontendDev --> BackendDev : loopback HTTP
BackendDev --> DevelopmentDatabase : isolated development database

note right of NativeProvider
  No database server: the backend opens one
  SQLite file through the bundled Bun and the
  system SQLite 3.39.0 or later (ADR-263).
  Restores and Demo activations swap the whole
  database directory as one generation.
end note

note right of NativeDatabase
  Private data is outside Vision.app.
  WAL mode while the backend runs; backups
  carry a consistent snapshot (db.sqlite3).
end note

note right of NativeDemo
  Demo always selects native and never reads Vision data.
  First launch, reset, or seed change activates a copy of
  the packaged seed database with rollback until detailed
  readiness succeeds (ADR-114).
end note

@enduml
